{"t":"Drown Damage","s":"drown-damage-f4c6f","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_dcd703.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Drown Damage</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.8<br/>August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Drowning</nav>\n</aside>\n<b>Drown Damage</b> is one of the types of Magical Damage. It comes in many forms. Drown Damage appears in <font class=\"tibiatext\" color=\"cyan\">Cyan</font> text. <b>Drown Damage</b> is represented in the Damage Input Analyser and <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Cyclopedia</a> with the following icon: <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Drown%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Drown Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_dcd703.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span>.\n<p>Players are not able to use this damage type by themselves.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Protection\">Protection</span></h2>\n<p>List of equipment that can provide some protection against drown damage.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Item\n</th>\n<th>Arm\n</th>\n<th><small>Weight</small>\n</th>\n<th>Attributes\n</th>\n<th>Resist.\n</th>\n<th><small>Imb. Slots</small>\n</th>\n<th><small>Class.</small>\n</th>\n<th>Lvl\n</th>\n<th>Vocation\n</th>\n<th>Dropped By\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div style=\"min-width:120px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Depth%20Galea\"><img alt=\"Depth Galea\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Depth_Galea_5bb93b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Depth%20Galea\">Depth Galea</a></div>\n</td>\n<td>8\n</td>\n<td>46.00\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>drowning +100%\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>150\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"div-creature-list-generic creature-table\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Jaul\">Jaul</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div style=\"min-width:120px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\"><img alt=\"Helmet of the Deep\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Helmet_of_the_Deep_fb3803.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\">Helmet of the Deep</a></div>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>210.00\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>drowning +100%\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Weak Against Drown Damage</li>\n<li>Neutral Against Drown Damage</li>\n<li>Strong Against Drown Damage</li>\n<li>Immune Against Drown Damage</li></ul>\n</div>","quests":["grave-danger-quest"]}